WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.310
Flaga!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:28.850
Stop.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.930
Stop taking from me!

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.720
Stop!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.400
That was...

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.500
<i>Calm down, act natural!</i>

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.490
<i>Calm down and assess the situation!</i>

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.960
<i>Why isn't she dressed?</i>

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.470
Ed-sama, I'm cold.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.350
Angela-san, stop!

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.630
This is bad!

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:22.410
This is really bad!

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.060
You're awake.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.070
Yes. Thanks to you.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.730
Thank goodness.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.400
Um, well, your boobs are touching me.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.710
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:45.610
It's not like we're cuddling 
after we just did it or anything!

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:46.910
I know, I know.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.670
I-I had to do it for the treatment!

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:02.980
Damn.

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.780
Haimura!

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.310
Idiot.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.460
Idiot!

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.140
You may be going to war by yourself,

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.650
but why would you help me?

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:32.240
This is all I can do for you.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.480
<i>Wake up. Please, wake up.</i>

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.120
Well, y'know, uh, yeah!

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:54.830
I'm glad you're okay.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.770
Angela-san.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.010
Eh?

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.360
Thank you.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.060
Stop watching me change!

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.070
Sorry.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.910
You perverted brat! I'll kill you!

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.130
How's it going?

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.770
M-My bad, I didn't know you were having sex.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:22.050
Take your time.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.970
That's not true!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.630
I'm Katya Eskevna Honda.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.880
I'm half Japanese and half Russian.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.370
Yekaterinburg district leader, 18 years old.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.210
I already heard that.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.370
So, how did you learn about this place?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.580
I had one of my direct subordinates

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.120
follow you since you arrived at the station.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.670
Th-Then why didn't you come in?

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.720
Don't kid.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.190
You guys looked murderous.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:31.640
Besides, I don't really want 
to fight against Haimura-han.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.380
Haimura-han's been making sure

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:37.120
he doesn't kill anyone 
he fought, not just me.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:42.400
When I saw that, I decided this 
person would surely grant me my wish.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.150
Your wish?

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:48.910
Help my best friend Yuli get 
away from the Lightning Emperor.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:55.910
Did you know?

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.310
Most Saviors in Russia don't have family.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.420
That way, no one will complain 
if they get treated poorly.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.420
The Lightning Emperor gathers those 
kids to make them fight each other.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:11.290
And she makes the survivors her bodyguards.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.750
So, this friend Yuli of yours is 
still with the Lightning Emperor.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.460
Then she's there where you're going, correct?

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.570
The Lightning Emperor.

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.950
Sverdlovsk capital Yekaterinburg.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:34.630
I see.

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:37.210
Yeah, I'll call you later.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.190
Where are you going?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:43.460
Washroom. What about you?

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.820
Nothing.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:45.590
Anyway...

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.350
Want to go together?

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:48.790
Fool!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:52.420
Anyway, did you predict 
that this would happen?

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.540
Predict what?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:58.910
You said I'd eventually find out why 
you're not killing anyone in this war.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.040
Of course not.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.250
Things would be a lot easier 
if I could be so calculating.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:02.860
But...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:10.330
I just had faith that there are 
proper-minded people in the Russia branch.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.530
You're an amazing man.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.280
Second to Edward-sama.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.170
<b>Yekaterinburg Station</b>

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.940
Finally.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.130
There.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:34.090
Another head flick?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.390
I don't think she'll wake up for a while now.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.560
Are you sure we don't need to bring her?

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.670
She seems like she'd make a good soldier.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:42.870
No.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.630
Katya-san is needed in Russia's tomorrow.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.940
I'm amazed you can care about 
another nation so much.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:54.450
If you want to fight with a clear 
conscience, you have to have motivation.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.490
Isn't that true?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.330
Smartass.

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:06.380
Hey, do you really not need my sword, too?

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:11.130
I couldn't see eye-to-eye with Edward-san 
if anything to happen to you.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.850
I can take care of myself.

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:15.430
Let's stop playing tough.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.650
I don't have the confidence 
to protect someone

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:20.600
while I'm fighting the Lightning Emperor.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.600
I seriously hate you.

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:28.610
I like you a lot.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:32.820
Dammit.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.890
Haimura didn't kill any of us.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.190
That very naiveté is his weakness.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:44.300
It wasn't because I fled 
that I came back to you—

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.190
Enough.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.170
Failure is not forgivable.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.380
You will die. No exemptions.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.140
N-No.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.270
Your Majesty.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.160
Lightning Emperor!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.740
Now, then.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.660
I'm here, Lightning Emperor.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:28.170
Shall I begin preparing for your greetings?

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.630
Write!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:30.330
<b>Dance, dance, soldier of lightning.</b>

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.240
<b>Come, countless thunders.</b>

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.660
<b>None of this world live forever. Ephemeral sparkles, embrace pleasure.</b>

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:33.580
<b>Destroy everything in the blink of an eye.</b>

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.000
<b>Do not regret being late, it is a once-in-a-thousand-years banquet.</b>

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:36.920
<b>Die, die, die, die.</b>

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.830
<b>All life must perish. Deliverance of the soul is simple.</b>

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.750
<b>Remove your heavy clothes, the comfort of journeying heaven and earth.</b>

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:41.670
<b>Kill, kill, kill, kill.</b>

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.090
<b>Share with all this lightness, this elegance, this freedom, this happiness.</b>

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:45.090
<b>Oh, death, so sweet!</b>

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.090
<b>Die, die, die, die. Kill, kill, kill, kill.</b>

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.970
<b>It is a once-in-a-thousand-years banquet of killing.</b>

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:57.570
That's...

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:07.070
My level 13 Dark Arts, Cruel Crusaders.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:10.090
How will you fight against 
this army of lightning?

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.760
Come, Saratiga!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.540
Here I come!

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.650
<i>There's just too many of them.</i>

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.530
Then...

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.560
Perfectly prepared for anti-air intercept?

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:57.130
Let's do it.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.040
What trickery is this?

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:14.780
My Cruel Crusaders defeated a 
Dreadnought class in minutes.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.790
With respect, Lightning Emperor,

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.120
I believe this is not 
trickery, but military art.

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:22.820
Haimura moves so fast that not 
even lightning beasts can keep up.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:26.290
He's focusing on attacking only 
each of the enemies before him.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.750
Therefore he's fighting not 
one against a thousand,

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.630
but one against one a thousand times.

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.870
It's as though he's a 
military genius general.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:37.590
It's as though he's comfortable with 
fighting an entire army by himself.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.260
Very well.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:45.550
If he's going to fight with military art, 
then I'll respond with military art.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.020
All right.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.790
<i>They're the captive Saviors that 
Katya-san was talking about.</i>

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:10.630
Are we really doing this?

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.790
We have no choice.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:16.040
Now, kids, it's time to make yourself 
useful to our savior, Her Majesty!

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.000
Your comrades are here!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.820
Stop. Stop, Lightning Emperor!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:43.650
It's just as Darco said.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.320
He can't kill people.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.980
This is my military art.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.330
Impressive, Your Majesty.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:57.520
<i>My body...</i>

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:07.260
Yuli's gravity trap is working.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.090
Yes.

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.390
What the hell are you doing?!

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.850
Die, Haimura!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:32.690
Angela Johnson of the UK branch.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.530
By White Knight Sir Edward Lampard's orders,

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.540
I hereby defend Haimura Moroha.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.040
My best friend's in trouble, 
I can't be sleeping.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.360
You two...

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.920
Not two.

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.480
Nii-sama!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.920
Satsuki, Shizuno.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.780
This is the Lightning Emperor's castle.

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.040
It's quite tasteless.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.940
A Transportal, I see.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.940
That's a useful magic.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.190
There're more?!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.560
What do we do?

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.720
Yuli.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.980
Who are you?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.320
Why do you know my name?

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:09.630
Yuli.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:13.740
All these nobodies, and then some.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.080
Children of Russia, listen to me.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.850
I am Elena Arshavina.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:21.740
You know me as a man eater.

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:25.060
But that man eater no longer exists.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.330
She went to Japan and fought Haimura Moroha,

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.510
and became no more.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.290
I was reborn as just Elena.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.980
Moroha told me

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.540
to be reborn.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:43.730
So now I'm going to share 
that sentiment with you.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.930
I want you all to be reborn

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:48.750
and become people who fight 
only to protect someone.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:52.240
Move, I'll do it.

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.770
Yuli.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:56.680
What are you doing? It's me, Katya.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.600
I, I...

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.270
Yuli Olegovich Jilkov.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.440
What was I...

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:11.050
I knew it.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.580
Yuli!

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:13.340
Katya.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:16.710
Yeah, it's me, your best friend Katya.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.770
All right, let's take out 
the lightning beasts!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.270
Got it!

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.870
I'm gonna do this!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:26.610
Me, too.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.200
What about you guys?

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:29.850
Huh?

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.110
Us?

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:34.120
Take the Lightning Emperor down with us.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.670
Be gone, freaks!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.590
No you don't.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.550
<b>As water flows from high to low, take all life.</b>

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.550
<b>All must die and return to bone. Begin the ceremony of fire.</b>

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.560
Freezing Shade.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.560
Incinerate.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.030
Contact the Russian government.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:12.280
No...

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:16.000
Tell them that Yekaterinburg 
is about to disappear.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:23.500
Haimura, go to the Lightning Emperor.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.200
But...

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.790
The only one that can defeat her is—

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:29.370
A song?

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.570
A lightning...

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:16.800
...giant.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.420
Perfectly prepared for 
ground surround attack,

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.210
perfectly prepared for anti-air intercept,

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.140
and to top it off, she's prepared 
with a boss character.

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:40.880
Dreadful Blizzard.

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:41.830
Blaze Storm.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.800
Write!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.910
<b>There exists purgatory in the netherworld
 and fields of fire in the corporeal world.</b>

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:51.830
<b>Fire discriminates not against good and 
evil as it burns and purifies with ferocious mercy.</b>

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.330
<b>All must die and return to bone.</b>

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.830
<b>God has forsaken humanity.</b>

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.340
<b>The world of the decadent is eternal.
 Let the trumpets blare and bring the moment of judgment.</b>

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.180
Yin Yang Kurikara!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.610
Even with Nii-sama's Yin Yang...

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:24.180
Everyone, get down!

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.050
Now!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.800
No way.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.640
The next one's coming!

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.950
Urushibara, defense magic!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:46.890
It'd be useless against it.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:49.180
Yuli.

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:49.900
Katya.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:53.970
This is the end.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.410
I remember.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.830
You're the one that used it first.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.380
I won't accept any complaints.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.130
Write!

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:13.620
<b>Everything began with water.</b>

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:15.120
<b>Everything will return to water.</b>

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:16.620
<b>Therefore water is life and death.</b>

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:18.130
<b>The birthing mother and the swallowing snake.</b>

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.120
<b>Everything flows. Not even time itself can escape.</b>

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.880
It's the thirteenth level.

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:23.130
<b>Like a boat at the mercy of a mighty river, all are swallowed in the end.</b>

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:23.140
He's going to use a forbidden curse?

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.630
<b>Oh, heartless nature of transience.</b>

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.630
<b>Yet I will love that heartlessness and transience deeply.</b>

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.130
<b>I have long forgotten my mother's face.</b>

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.130
<b>My body will become a snake with its 
mouth wide open, and level everything.</b>

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.720
<b>Insatiable, endless emptiness.</b>

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.300
<b>Endless pleasure, never stagnating.</b>

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.430
<b>All things must flow, back into my stomach.</b>

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.290
Ouroboros!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.160
No way!

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:52.250
Amazing.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.880
This is Haimura's...

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.130
...new forbidden curse.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.630
Dammit, I can't swim!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.350
Hang on, Katya.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.070
Impossible.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.430
Wait!

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.090
Where do you think you're going?

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:10.300
Does it matter?

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.980
The empire is done for!

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.830
I'm more afraid of Haimura than I am of you.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.000
A tyrant's end is pretty pathetic, huh?

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:25.340
I haven't lost yet.

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:31.730
Thunderbolt Dragon!

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.660
Are you finished?

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:57.290
I promise to never lay my hands on you again.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:01.030
In fact, I would serve you.

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:03.750
So please, stop.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.630
You purge your men mercilessly for failure.

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:10.050
Yet you plead for your life?

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:12.000
I don't want to die.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.330
I don't want to lose the empire.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:19.150
Please don't take away that 
which is important to me.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:25.140
Why?

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:29.660
Why do you people not understand 
something so simple?

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:33.740
If you don't want to be taken from,

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.160
stop taking!

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:44.800
I'm defeated.

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:56.030
Nii-sama.

00:22:56.030 --> 00:22:57.070
Brother!

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:04.970
He actually pulled it off all the way.

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:09.080
He didn't kill anyone in the war.

00:23:14.430 --> 00:23:16.200
Yes, understood.

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:22.210
How did it go?

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:25.210
Everyone's safe.

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.470
Haimura-kun's coming home.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.050
Yay!

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:34.670
<i>The days are long in the northern lands.</i>

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:40.010
<i>No doubt the sun is gently shining 
on Moroha-san and the others.</i>

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:46.200
<i>But at the time, I didn't know</i>

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:49.400
<i>that the midnight sun would
 never come to Yekaterinburg.</i>

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:54.990
<i>That the sun will eventually set 
and bring a ominous, cold night.</i>

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:24.940
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:15.730 --> 00:24:18.800
I'm not giving back 
Haimura-han, no matter what!

00:24:18.800 --> 00:24:20.930
Katya, put on some clothes.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:23.500
Next time, episode 11: 
"The Nightmare From the Previous Life."

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:25.250
We are the saviors!
